  ...) in Dyl:QuickDrawGallery (Apps\Draw\Dyl-QuickDraw.lsp), which gives the groups (grp)
  and a tile for each preset (gal/list: its name, its group and the preview of its hatch, see
  Installer\Windows\Engine\Hatch.cs). The group and the search filter the tiles in the window
  itself (Gallery.cs); a tile clicked closes it with its index (gal), and the preset is drawn.
  Quick Draw Manager closes it with 2: the Quick Draw window opens in its place.
